{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GeneRally 2 is a friendly top-down arcade racing game - with an easy-to-use, built-in track editor.</strong> GeneRally 2 is the sequel to the 2002 classic, GeneRally - one of the most played arcade racing games of all time! Have fun racing alone against computer-controlled opponents; with your friends in &quot;no split-screen necessary&quot; couch PvP; online with players from around the world; or try your hand at creating tracks and sharing them with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeneRally 2 is on the home stretch of Early Access - and will soon be reaching v1.0. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.poster.avif?t=1767299069\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.webm?t=1767299069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.mp4?t=1767299069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down arcade racing game fun!</strong> The gameplay is easy to pick up, but with plenty of room for mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race online or offline - with friends, or against computer-controlled opponents!</strong> With online multiplayer, you can race with GeneRally 2 players from all over the world - but you can also gather up to 7 friends and play in no-splitscreen-necessary couch co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 unique cars.</strong> Rally, Single-Seater, Stock Car, Monster Truck, GT - you name it! Each car has its own performance characteristics and unique handling model. And more cars are being added on a regular basis!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1000 tracks (and counting)...</strong> Our community has produced over a thousand tracks to date, and more are being created every day and uploaded to Steam Workshop. If that's not enough, create your own tracks, or import and race any of the tens of thousands that were created for GeneRally 1!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own tracks.</strong> Using our built-in track editor, making the racing circuits of your dreams couldn't be easier! No special knowledge required. Join our track-making community and share your creations with the world.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Would One Win One, Juan?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/51736f5d3e38c9170d4ede844e10a8c505e51bfa.jpg"},{"name":"The Track is My Canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/258b57ebad78a0b74a65df79816bb0d22e7643c6.jpg"},{"name":"Work, Dedication and Competence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/9b05a0b9fdcefd9bdcad5deb7cfb297ea6e01ad7.jpg"},{"name":"Just Leave Me Alone, I Know What to Do","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/6d5f97f862abfbc1ae9c2210060fb3340932d000.jpg"},{"name":"To Finish First, First You Have To Finish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/1eaf5462ef24043221523a6c3c377dd76511d0b3.jpg"},{"name":"Not Finished Yet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/e6c0019b2aa8bdc9b6c0bf979c48c5d871073181.jpg"},{"name":"Nearly Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/5635b9c9587a1b1be792251b95be2778899d43f5.jpg"},{"name":"Totally Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/8689a9b7bbd762a493e8e2304390f812dbbb65ee.jpg"},{"name":"Box, box, box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/de0a5934bfa07e68338d8b38277dbe43c19b4eab.jpg"},{"name":"Stop-and-go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2104920/54edccba6eef9c9ee25b73bf28faa8dd63d38c8b.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2104920?t=1767299069","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767299069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/f3a7e07260fcb5d7d1e45cbc53365ca636eab3c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767299069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/f3a7e07260fcb5d7d1e45cbc53365ca636eab3c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767299069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Now with Online Multiplayer!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now race <strong>online with your friends, or other players from around the world</strong>. Enjoy racing with our full fleet of 10 cars and over 1000 community-made tracks!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GeneRally 2 is a friendly top-down arcade racing game - with an easy-to-use, built-in track editor.</strong> GeneRally 2 is the sequel to the 2002 classic, GeneRally - one of the most played arcade racing games of all time! Have fun racing alone against computer-controlled opponents; with your friends in &quot;no split-screen necessary&quot; couch PvP; online with players from around the world; or try your hand at creating tracks and sharing them with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeneRally 2 is on the home stretch of Early Access - and will soon be reaching v1.0. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.poster.avif?t=1767299069\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.webm?t=1767299069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.mp4?t=1767299069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down arcade racing game fun!</strong> The gameplay is easy to pick up, but with plenty of room for mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race online or offline - with friends, or against computer-controlled opponents!</strong> With online multiplayer, you can race with GeneRally 2 players from all over the world - but you can also gather up to 7 friends and play in no-splitscreen-necessary couch co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 unique cars.</strong> Rally, Single-Seater, Stock Car, Monster Truck, GT - you name it! Each car has its own performance characteristics and unique handling model. And more cars are being added on a regular basis!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1000 tracks (and counting)...</strong> Our community has produced over a thousand tracks to date, and more are being created every day and uploaded to Steam Workshop. If that's not enough, create your own tracks, or import and race any of the tens of thousands that were created for GeneRally 1!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own tracks.</strong> Using our built-in track editor, making the racing circuits of your dreams couldn't be easier! No special knowledge required. Join our track-making community and share your creations with the world.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Curious Chicken Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/3d6b932d554ce660dc0dd28b6790a21ee9691dab/header.jpg?t=1767299069","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\"GeneRally\" is a registered trademark of Curious Chicken Games Oy. GeneRally 2's development has been financially supported by Business Finland.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / Ubuntu 18.04 / CentOS 7 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit processor with support for SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 900 series or later (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2104920/1172905718/793f79ebd420a6ffc2d3eae67ef095c60ac4d57c/1751076651/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746809590","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2104920/1172905718/793f79ebd420a6ffc2d3eae67ef095c60ac4d57c/1751076651/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746809590","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2104920/1172905718/793f79ebd420a6ffc2d3eae67ef095c60ac4d57c/1751076651/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746809590","id":257137226,"name":"GeneRally 2 Online Multiplayer Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137226/841d4967f01e4324186431c0e995a9e66630139f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746809590"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2104920/566581/3bb7555b04441377da81453c8ec48a8497bede16/1751076648/dash_av1.mpd?t=1683799068","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2104920/566581/3bb7555b04441377da81453c8ec48a8497bede16/1751076648/dash_h264.mpd?t=1683799068","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2104920/566581/3bb7555b04441377da81453c8ec48a8497bede16/1751076648/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1683799068","id":256946224,"name":"GeneRally 2 Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256946224/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1683799068"}],"name":"GeneRally 2","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"GeneRally 2 - $14.99 USD","packageid":752352,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text